  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 8a43310c7a94bc6468303c0795ab3887, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  people:
  - name: ChatGPT
    title: The Brain Behind the Curtain
    contribution: Helped think through gameplay logic, Unity systems, debugging,
      and the tiny details that turn a prototype into a real board game.
    funFact: An unlimited supply of ideas. Not all of them were requested.
    achievement: Infinite Suggestions Generator
  - name: Gemini
    title: The Imagination Machine
    contribution: Contributed creative brainstorming, visual directions, and fresh
      ways to imagine the game.
    funFact: Can turn one simple idea into twelve possible designs.
    achievement: Imagination Overdrive
  - name: Macpan
    title: The Master Linker
    contribution: Brought all the moving pieces together, connected the systems,
      and carried the game toward the finish line.
    funFact: I'm the creator. Fuck you all.
    achievement: Chief Chaos Integrator
  - name: Tahsan
    title: The Property Architect
    contribution: Provided creative intelligence and designed the properties that
      give the board its own identity.
    funFact: He is black and lean. Lost Toha
    achievement: Lord of the Properties
  - name: Purna
    title: The Idea Generator
    contribution: Shared ideas that helped shape the experience and make the game
      more fun.
    funFact: She is a human but weired one. Sad for Abrar
    achievement: Brainstorm Champion
  - name: Turjo
    title: The Royal Advisor
    contribution: Gave suggestions and useful perspectives during development.
    funFact: Peacefull but weired guy..
    achievement: Council of Good Ideas
  - name: Toha
    title: Chief Motivation Officer
    contribution: "An honorary part of this game's story \u2014 here for motivation,
      friendship, and the fun of it."
    funFact: Love. Our love. Our day & night. Love her...
    achievement: Emotional Support DLC
